  "limitations": [
    "Self-probe success does not establish commercial driver compatibility or publisher support.",
    "A sampled AMD64 driver does not prove that every publisher channel lacks ARM64 drivers.",
    "A native ARM64 binary does not prove that virtualized environments are supported.",
    "Local observations remain separate from official public-document evidence.",
    "Guest kernel architecture is ARM64; a transport or PowerShell process reporting AMD64 under user-mode emulation must not override the kernel architecture observation.",
    "The original before-experiment configuration is retained only for fields directly established by the earlier preflight and Secure Boot rejection; unspecified original fields remain unknown.",
    "The test-signing request was initially rejected with native exit code 1 despite a historical outer wrapper exit code 0. Later success required the approved temporary Secure Boot change and a verified reboot.",
    "The first inventory operation produced no confirmed result and encountered Guest Agent RPC timeouts. A later normal powerdown confirmed Guest stop and terminated the outstanding execution; its original native exit code is unavailable. The cause remains undetermined."
  ]
